    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT · SENIOR UX DESIGNER · BENGALURU, INDIA</p>
    <h1>Designing clarity into complex digital experiences.</h1>
    <p class="about-lede">I'm Gyaneshwar S. Mule, a Senior UX Designer with 20+ years of experience in digital design and more than a decade specialising in user experience. I work across research, workflow analysis and interaction design to turn complex enterprise processes and data-rich products into experiences people can understand and use with confidence.</p>
    <div class="about-actions"><a class="about-button" href="/uxgyan2/Gyaneshwar_Mule_Senior_UX_Designer_Resume_Oct26.pdf" download>Download resume <span>↓</span></a><a class="about-button secondary" href="/uxgyan2/#work">Explore selected work ↗</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE AT A GLANCE</p><h2>Experience grounded in complex products.</h2>
    <div class="about-stats">
      <div class="about-stat"><strong>20+</strong><span>Years in digital design</span></div>
      <div class="about-stat"><strong>10+</strong><span>Years specialising in UX</span></div>
      <div class="about-stat"><strong>80,000+</strong><span>Enterprise users across products I've designed</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="about-body">My experience spans cloud operations, banking, insurance, e-commerce, manufacturing and enterprise platforms. I partner with product, engineering, business and global stakeholders to balance user needs, business goals and implementation realities. I also mentor junior designers and contribute to UX quality, consistency and design direction.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">HOW I WORK</p><h2>From understanding the problem to validating the experience.</h2>
    <div class="about-skills"><span>User research</span><span>Workflow analysis</span><span>Information architecture</span><span>User flows</span><span>Interaction design</span><span>Wireframing</span><span>Interactive prototyping</span><span>Usability testing</span><span>Design iteration</span><span>Heuristic evaluation</span><span>Accessibility & usability</span><span>Cross-functional collaboration</span></div>
    <p class="about-body" style="margin-top:22px">My toolkit includes Figma, Miro, Adobe Photoshop and Illustrator, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap and interactive HTML prototypes. I also use GitHub Copilot, AI-assisted prototyping and agentic workflows to explore ideas and accelerate design work.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="about-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">CAREER</p><h2>A design career across industries and disciplines.</h2>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Dec 2021 – Present</div><div><h3>Kyndryl India Pvt. Ltd. · Lead UX Designer</h3><p>Designing enterprise platforms and complex workflows, conducting user research and workflow analysis, creating flows and prototypes, facilitating usability testing, and collaborating with product, engineering and business stakeholders. Selected work includes Integrated AIOps, DSRR Candidacy Dashboard, Business Service Insights, Consolidated Notification Services and Actionable Insights.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Apr 2014 – Dec 2021</div><div><h3>Tata Consultancy Services · UX / UI Designer</h3><p>Worked across enterprise UX and UI engagements for Jaguar Land Rover (UK), Aegon Insurance (UK) and PwC (UK), including stakeholder workshops, user journeys, research, mockups and collaboration with global delivery teams.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Sep 2013 – Feb 2014</div><div><h3>IT Village Software Solutions · UI Designer</h3><p>Contributed interface and visual design solutions across projects.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Jan 2013 – Aug 2013</div><div><h3>Toboc International · Graphic Designer</h3><p>Created website and mobile-app designs, advertising banners and brochures.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Jan 2010 – Dec 2012</div><div><h3>GyanArt · Freelance Designer</h3><p>Delivered freelance design work, including user journeys and mockups, working with clients and delivery stakeholders.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Dec 2006 – Aug 2009</div><div><h3>Prosems Web Solutions · Web Designer</h3><p>Designed websites and supported design delivery for client projects.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">Jun 2002 – Apr 2004</div><div><h3>COMMITS Convergence Institute of Media · Design Faculty</h3><p>Taught graphic design, video editing and print media.</p></div></div>
    <div class="about-timeline"><div class="about-date">May 1997 – Jun 2000</div><div><h3>Mandhana Bornemann Industries · Textile Designer</h3><p>Trained to use textile design software and worked as a textile designer.</p></div></div>
